  "description": "In a world where your weapon is a literal mirror of your soul, your strength is determined by the depth and sincerity of your beliefs. Only a select few are able to summon swords of their soul, and those who can, are deemed “Warriors.” Meet Allen, a kind-hearted warrior-wannabe who refuses to let a cruel world change him. While others seek power out of pure greed, Allen’s heart of pure gold drives him to protect everyone with the unstoppable Sword of Purity. But the road to becoming a hero is rigged. The official qualification exams are strictly controlled by the realm’s apex executioners, the 10 swords of the king… who don’t seem too benevolent either. Can this boy who refuses to harm innocents grow strong enough to stay true to his path?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
